-        type: string
-        description: >
-          What caused the error. One of:
-
-          - `backwards-sync`: The collection would have synced backwards.
-          - `empty`: The collection is empty. (This is not strictly speaking an
-            error, but there is usually at least one live experiment or rollout
-            in each collection.)
-          - `get-exception`: RemoteSettingsClient.get() threw an exception.
-          - `invalid-data`: The collection did not return an array.
-          - `invalid-last-modified`: The collection returned an invalid value
-            for lastModified.
-          - `last-modified-exception`: Asking the collection for the lastModified
-            triggered an exception.
-          - `null-last-modified`: The collection was empty but lastModified was
-            null (i.e., not synced).
