-  font_hinting:
-    type: string
-    description: >
-      The font hinting style. On Linux this is the GNOME
-      org.gnome.desktop.interface font-hinting setting, one of "none", "slight",
-      "medium", or "full". Hinting reshapes glyph outlines, so it affects
-      rasterized output including canvas text readback. Not set on other
-      platforms, which expose no comparable per-user setting.
-    lifetime: application
-    send_in_pings:
-      - user-characteristics
-    notification_emails:
