-  font_rgba_order:
-    type: string
-    description: >
-      The subpixel (LCD) element order. On Linux this is the GNOME
-      org.gnome.desktop.interface font-rgba-order setting, one of "rgba", "rgb",
-      "bgr", "vrgb", or "vbgr". On Windows it is the ClearType orientation
-      (SPI_GETFONTSMOOTHINGORIENTATION), normalized to "rgb" or "bgr" (Windows
-      exposes no vertical variants). Only affects rendering when subpixel
-      antialiasing is active (see font_smoothing_type); it does not affect
-      canvas readback, which is grayscale. Not set on macOS or Android.
